<title>BRAZIL: Brazil CS sugar output to January 1 - AIAA.</title>
<headline>Brazil CS sugar output to January 1 - AIAA.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results to January 1 of the 1996/97 sugar harvest in Brazil's centre-south region were as follows, said the Association of Sugar and Alcohol Industries of Sao Paulo (AIAA).</p>
<p>				    1996/97	     1995/96</p>
<p>				01/01    16/12     01/01    16/12</p>
<p>CANE(million tonnes)   231.40   230.14    203.59   202.73</p>
<p>SUGAR(million tonnes)   10.42    10.39	9.24     9.20</p>
<p>ALCOHOL(million cubic meters)</p>
<p>				12.09    12.01     10.83    10.76</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
